  "cover_text": "Residential buildings account for a significant amount of the national electricity consumption. In which geographic region is railway housing located? ____\nA. Western region\nB. Central region\nC. Southern region\nD. Northeastern region\nA. Western region\nB. Central region\nC. Southern region\nD. Northeastern region\nAnswer:\nA\n\nThe main measures for preventing hypertension include ____.\nA. Limiting alcohol to one glass per day\nB. Reducing salt intake, keeping sodium within 150mg/Kg\nC. Increasing intramuscular injections of aluminum and magnesium per day to prevent low-grade fever and dehydration\nD. Choosing antibiotic treatment to reduce viral load\nAnswer:\nABCD\n\n____ is the most fundamental safety requirement for cargo vehicles.\nA. Cargo compartment safety\nB. Visible structure safety\nC. Vehicle body structure safety\nD. Door and window safety\nAnswer:\nC以下关于3Ghz frequency band characteristics, which one is incorrect?\nHigh spectral efficiency * Low maximum",
